# Escape Room Simulator (Web App)

A web-based escape room experience simulator.

## Goals (framework first)
- Provide a page/app shell that can host rooms, puzzles, inventory, and interactions.
- Use a clean folder structure so we can add gameplay logic later.

## Next steps
- Decide tech stack (default: Vite + React or vanilla + modules).
- Create core data model for rooms/puzzles.
- Add UI components (scene, dialogue, inventory, puzzle panel).
